      "line_index": 0,
      "text": "Letters Orders and Instructions. October 1755.-2B7.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line000.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 1,
      "text": "25th. To Ensign Fleming, of the Virginia Regiment-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line001.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 2,
      "text": "You are hereby Ordered to repain to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line002.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 3,
      "text": "Captain Hogg's Company at Fort Dinmddie,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line003.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 4,
      "text": "with eight good men: as that Company is",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line004.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 5,
      "text": "without a Surgeon, if you will do that duty, an",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line005.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 6,
      "text": "allowance will be made you for it. You are-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line006.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 7,
      "text": "to provide medicines, c. upon the best terms",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line007.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 8,
      "text": "you can. This Order Sexpect will be immedi-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line008.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 9,
      "text": "ately complied with; and that no Delayo be of-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line009.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 10,
      "text": "fered.- you are to account with Captain Bell",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line010.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 11,
      "text": "for your recruiting money, before you leave him,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line011.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 12,
      "text": "If you should arrive at Augus ta Court- House",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line012.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 13,
      "text": "before Sergeant Wilper and his Party, you are to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line013.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 14,
      "text": "halt there until he joins, in order to escort the",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line014.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 15,
      "text": "ammunition, c. for the Fort; where you will",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line015.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 16,
      "text": "receive Clothes and Arms for the men.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line016.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 17,
      "text": "3t. To Captain Bell, of the VirginiaRegiment.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line017.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 18,
      "text": "Thave Ordered Cnsign Fleming",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line018.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 19,
      "text": "to Repair to Captain Hoggs Company witheigkt",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line019.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 20,
      "text": "good men; which S expect you will see immedi",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line020.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 21,
      "text": "ately complied with. He is to account with you",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line021.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 22,
      "text": "for his recruiting money before he leaves you-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line022.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 23,
      "text": "You are hereby ordered, peremptorily, to be at",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line023.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 24,
      "text": "this place with what men you have, or can en-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line024.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 25,
      "text": "list by the 1st. of December. Your late disobedi-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line025.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 26,
      "text": "ence of Orders has greatly displeased me- It is",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line026.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 27,
      "text": "impossible to carry on affairs as they ought to be,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line027.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 28,
      "text": "when you pay solittle regard to the Force of a",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line028.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 29,
      "text": "mililary Order- You must be conscious within",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line029.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 30,
      "text": "yourself tor at least ought to be that your crime",
      "crop_path": "line_images/271/271_line030.png"
    },
    {
